    "text": "By Peter Rauterkus ,\n12 hours ago Auburn added to its 2027 recruiting class on Wednesday, landing a commitment from three-star offensive lineman Jaylon Moore. He becomes Auburn’s fourth commitment in the class of 2027 and the third on offense. Moore is also the second in the last week, joining four-star running back Myson Johnson-Cook. Moore... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
